# Agent Pack Pipeline

## Content Flow

```
packages/agent-pack/src/          → packages/cli/agent-pack-src/
(source of truth — edit directly)    (bundled with CLI — copy to sync)
```

## Sync to CLI

After editing agent pack content, sync to the CLI bundle:
```bash
cp -r packages/agent-pack/src/* packages/cli/agent-pack-src/
```

## What Goes Where

| Content | Location | Edit Where |
|---------|----------|------------|
| Core docs | `packages/agent-pack/src/core/` | Edit directly |
| Module docs | `packages/agent-pack/src/modules/` | Edit directly |
| Recipes | `packages/agent-pack/src/recipes/` | Edit directly |
| Skills | `packages/agent-pack/src/skills/` | Edit directly |
| Hooks | `packages/agent-pack/src/hooks/` | Edit directly |
| Components | `packages/agent-pack/src/components/` | Edit directly |

**Rule**: All agent pack content is edited directly in `packages/agent-pack/src/`. Always sync changes to `packages/cli/agent-pack-src/`.

## Research Folder

The `research/` folder contains **reference material** — battle-tested apps, mini-apps, and libraries. These are NOT synced to the agent pack. They serve as ground truth when writing or updating documentation.

```
research/
├── coffee-assistant/              # Battle-tested AI + P2P + RPC app
├── qvac-app-workbench-desktop-main/
├── qvac-app-workbench-mobile-main/
├── qvac-docs/
├── qvac-examples/
└── qvac-health-dev/
```

## Size Budgets

| File Type | Budget | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| SKILL.md | ≤4KB (~100 lines) | Thin invocation wrapper |
| core/*.md | ≤12KB (~300 lines) | Architecture & patterns |
| modules/*.md | ≤8KB (~150 lines) | Module overview + quick start |
| recipes/*.md | ≤15KB | Full implementation guides |

## CLI Builder Output

The CLI (`packages/cli/src/agent-pack/index.ts`) reads content and generates:

| Tool | Main File | Rules | Skills | Auto-activation |
|------|-----------|-------|--------|-----------------|
| Claude | `CLAUDE.md` (slim) | `.claude/rules/*.md` | `.claude/skills/` | `skill-rules.json` hook |
| Cursor | `.cursor/rules/project.mdc` | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Embedded in rules | `globs` frontmatter |
| OpenCode | `.opencode/instructions.md` | N/A | `.opencode/skills/` | Agent descriptions |
